for no reason counts as strange.

451
00:24:05,877 --> 00:24:08,877
That was way harsh, Taka.

452
00:24:10,877 --> 00:24:12,877
So child talk now?

453
00:24:12,877 --> 00:24:13,877
Yeah.

454
00:24:13,877 --> 00:24:14,877
It is probably not you it.

455
00:24:14,877 --> 00:24:15,877
Okay, my hand is up.

456
00:24:15,877 --> 00:24:16,877
Taka.

457
00:24:16,877 --> 00:24:18,877
Yes, four side asks this word.

458
00:24:18,877 --> 00:24:20,877
I'll hold the apple to tierra.

459
00:24:20,877 --> 00:24:26,877
But how can it seem to be if they're dai- doświad when it's gonna Engine.

460
00:24:27,577 --> 00:24:28,877
And it doesn't seem to t'all.

461
00:24:28,877 --> 00:24:29,877
I don't see yet.

462
00:24:29,877 --> 00:24:31,877
I'm using Buddy talking to them.

463
00:24:31,877 --> 00:24:33,877
donde' everybody Miller can use to drive through it.

464
00:24:33,877 --> 00:24:35,877
And of course it seems to be complicated.

465
00:24:35,877 --> 00:24:37,877
Let's do this thing.

